SHEH LA RAHE HAIN RUN SE NANHA SA EK JANAZA<br>
<br>
Sunkar sadae hal min jhule se ran mein pohnche<br>
Tashna dahan chale the khoo&rsquo;n me naha ke aye<br>
Maa ko gumaa&rsquo;n ye kab tha lautenge is tarha se<br>
Gardan dhali huwe thi tar khoo&rsquo;n mein pairahan tha<br>
<br>
Lagta tha aaraha hai sehraab hoke Asghar<br>
Soncha to ye nahin tha aayega khoo&rsquo;n naha kar<br>
Armaan bas yehi tha phule phale ye dilbar<br>
Ya rab kisi bhi maa ko manzar na ye dikhana<br>
<br>
Sukha huwa gala wo aur teer hurmula ka<br>
Wo teer ki aziyat wo karwatain badalna<br>
Sukhe huwe gale se darya-e-khoon ka behna<br>
Thame huwe dil apna manzar ye Sheh ne dekha<br>
<br>
Nanhi se jaan pa tooti Allah kya qayamat<br>
Jalta huwa wo sehra aur pyas ki wo shiddat<br>
Wo hichkiyan labon par wo teer ki aziyat<br>
Dunya mein kab kisi par aisa sitam huwa tha<br>
<br>
Sarwar ye sochte hai ab maa ko kya bataon<br>
Guzri jo us pe run mein rudaad kya sunao<br>
Kyu kar Rabaab ko ye zaqm-e-gulu dikhaon<br>
Ruk ruk ke har qadam par ye sonchte the moula<br>
<br>
Sehra-e-karbala mein manzar lahu lahu tha<br>
Dast-e-Hussain par tha ek be zuban ka lasha<br>
Tha aye Sohail mehshar Aale Nabi mein barpa<br>
Deti thi jab sada ye khaime ke dar se Fizza
